        "75e69abf-b790-4528-a52d-5a6b1364bb88": {
            "x": 64,
            "y": 32,
            "width": 672,
            "height": 224,
            "content": "## ⚠️ Test data assumption\n\n- The portal has the default ticket pipeline `0` (Support Pipeline) with the stage `1` (New) — every HubSpot portal gets them; set other IDs in CreateTicket if they were deleted.\n- The connected account needs the `tickets` scope (the connector requests it).\n- The 1 minute Wait between UpdateTicket and FindTickets must stay: FindTickets reads the CRM search index, which picks up the update a few seconds later.\n- The ticket is deleted at the end through MakeApiCall (there is no DeleteTicket component)."
        }
